1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Your agent is working.
You can't see it.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:07,000
Thinking, commands, the files it read —
all in the transcript

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:14,000
Cut in mid-turn with a correction

4
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:20,000
No waiting for it to finish,
no restarting the turn

5
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:23,000
Which lines changed, right there

6
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:31,000
Steps it can't say in prose,
it draws as nodes and edges

7
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:36,000
The risky step and the one
that needs your call look different

8
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:42,000
You walked away —
the finished turn pushes to your phone

9
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:45,000
Open source · MIT · loopback only
